
# Data Analyst Internship Portfolio

## ApexPlanet Software Pvt Ltd Internship

This repository contains the complete work completed during my Data Analyst Internship at ApexPlanet Software Pvt Ltd. The internship focused on developing practical skills in data analysis, visualization, and business intelligence.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python (Pandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn)
- SQL
- Power BI
- Google Colab
- GitHub

## Project Workflow

### Task 1 – Data Immersion & Wrangling
Explored the dataset, cleaned data, and prepared it for analysis.

### Task 2 – Exploratory Data Analysis
Performed descriptive statistics and created visualizations to understand patterns and trends.

### Task 3 – Interactive Dashboard
Developed a Power BI dashboard to visualize key business metrics.

### Task 4 – Data Storytelling & Statistical Validation
Performed hypothesis testing and presented insights through a business-focused presentation.

## Key Skills Developed
- Data Cleaning
- Data Visualization
- SQL Querying
- Dashboard Development
- Hypothesis Testing
- Data Storytelling

## Final Outcome
This portfolio demonstrates a complete end-to-end data analysis project, transforming raw data into actionable business insights.
